@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Student" as student
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
  usecase "View room availability" as UC_View
  usecase "Book room" as UC_Book
  usecase "Cancel own booking" as UC_Cancel
  usecase "Block room" as UC_Block
  usecase "Unblock room" as UC_Unblock
  usecase "Review room usage" as UC_Review
}

student --> UC_View
student --> UC_Book
student --> UC_Cancel

admin --> UC_Block
admin --> UC_Unblock
admin --> UC_Review

note right of UC_Book : R4 - a successful booking produces a confirmation. It is the result of booking, so it is not a separate use case.
@enduml
